### Alle Rollen
GET http://localhost:8080/role

### Rolle anlegen
POST http://localhost:8080/role
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "student"
}

### Student anlegen
POST http://localhost:8080/student
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstname": "Mira",
  "lastname": "Miro",
  "password": "geheim123",
  "email": "mira@test.de",
  "currentSemester": 3,
  "roleId": 1
}

### Alle Studenten
GET http://localhost:8080/student